Damien P. Neil (dpn2@po.CWRU.Edu) wrote:
: So, anyway, on my way down I've found two shrines (?) and a throne room. (I
: just went through the throne room (most monsters didn't even defend
: themselves.)

Shrines: Convert one of the altars.  If one is Lawful, you can use
it to create holy water.  Don't worry, converting a altar doesn't piss of
the priest.  However don't kill the priest unless you are certain that
you can do it.  They are pretty tough.  I usually don't.

After you convert the altar, you can give money to the priest.  I usually
will drop all but 4000 before entering the shrine, and then give all 4000
to him/her.  Sometimes I get some blessing.  Someone had a formula for
calculating how much to give a priest to get what blessing.  It was based
on level.

Throne: Get a very high luck.  A luck stone is a good start.  Throwing
gems to a unicorn of your alignment is good.  When you built up good
luck you then #sit on the throne.  The throne might do something for you.

